# Generated Reports
# ============================================================================================

coverage/
reports/

# ============================================================================================
# Backup Files
# ============================================================================================

*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Prometheus scrape credential for the local observability stack. /actuator/prometheus is
# authenticated by design (SecurityConfig permits only /actuator/health), so validating dashboards
# locally needs a real token -- which must never be committed. Ignored rather than documented-and-
# hoped-for: check-fixture-hygiene.sh scans staged content, but a JWT is not a shape it recognises.
ops/monitoring/scrape-token
